silm:instances_papers_11_base_commutative_diagram_chapters_22_bridges_cat_silmaril_forge_topology_granite_sections_05_bridge_granite_substrate_concrete_anchor_4_Mammal#mammal silm:hasLongDescription "The Mammal is the inferred mammal class; f:Cat->Mammal. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'Mammal', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
